@socialist_education
title: Socialist Education
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Needs a working TUR; Lewica grows stronger (+6) and its dissent falls (−5); for six months the flow of workers from PPS to the KPP is halved. Builds radicalism.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'czapinski', 'socialist_education').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_socialist_education_why +]
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'czapinski', 'socialist_education');
!}

